      "index": "b1Z",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "Speech $0.02, Jev $0.005, diagrams $0.01, export $0.002.\nWithout Jev, the LLM reads every sentence: ~$117k a month.\nJev costs ~$8k a month and saves ~$99k of that.\nLive tidy-up by LLM would add ~$22k: tidy once at export.\nNext lever: smaller diagram prompts (A: 1.5k tokens now).",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 81760203,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "text": "Speech $0.02, Jev $0.005, diagrams $0.01, export $0.002.\nWithout Jev, the LLM reads every sentence: ~$117k a month.\nJev costs ~$8k a month and saves ~$99k of that.\nLive tidy-up by LLM would add ~$22k: tidy once at export.\nNext lever: smaller diagram prompts (A: 1.5k tokens now).",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "updated": 1792580422027,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 770030230,
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
