      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "- GPU supply: reserve L4s in each region before school terms start\n- A region goes down: move its lessons to the nearest one (EU stays in EU)\n- Backups have limits too: check Deepgram's stream cap, OpenRouter's rate limit\n- ~10k browsers connected at peak: test Padlet's live updates channel\n- Load test: replay 10k fake lessons before back-to-school",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1842852804,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "text": "- GPU supply: reserve L4s in each region before school terms start\n- A region goes down: move its lessons to the nearest one (EU stays in EU)\n- Backups have limits too: check Deepgram's stream cap, OpenRouter's rate limit\n- ~10k browsers connected at peak: test Padlet's live updates channel\n- Load test: replay 10k fake lessons before back-to-school",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "updated": 1792580422027,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1058969738,
      "verticalAlign": "top"
